        <h4 class="sub-heading">2. Head-to-Head Score Matrix Table — CPD</h4>
        <p class="matrix-info">Row Player points earned vs Column Opponent per round:</p>
        <div class="table-responsive-wrapper matrix-compact-wrapper">
          <table class="matrix-table compact-matrix">
            <thead>
              <tr>
                <th>Player \ Opponent</th>
